<view class="interest-screen"><view class="eyebrow">为你定制 · 产学研</view><view class="hero">你对什么感兴趣？</view><view class="muted">可多选，按关键词筛选情报；不选择则浏览全部。之后可随时调整。</view><view wx:for="{{interestGroups}}" wx:key="id" class="interest-group"><view class="title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="interest-options"><view wx:for="{{item.options}}" wx:for-item="option" wx:key="id" class="interest-option {{option.selected ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-id="{{option.id}}" bindtap="toggleInterest">{{option.selected ? '✓ ' : ''}}{{option.label}}</view></view></view><view class="interest-actions"><text class="tag" bindtap="clearInterests">清空选择</text><button bindtap="confirmInterests">{{selectedInterests.length ? '保存兴趣并进入（' + selectedInterests.length + '）' : '浏览全部内容'}}</button></view></view>